ren: ren (native reader for Nextcloud News)
ren:
ren: Ren syncs the feeds, folders and articles of the News app of your
ren: Nextcloud, and whether you read or starred them, and works from its
ren: own copy, also offline. Articles are shown as the feed sends them;
ren: the web page behind an article opens in a tab, rendered by Servo,
ren: with ads and trackers blocked. Low memory and processor use come
ren: first.
